source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: A brace closer that would leave the content empty is not a closer, and the bare `*` inside it closes on the single-character content `{`.
-- input.jira --
a{*}{*}b
-- rendered.html --
<p>a<b>{</b>}b</p>
-- want.md --
a**{**}b
-- warnings.json --
[]
